map_description = "Welcome to the test map!

Tips:
- Use the teleporters!
- Destroy the turrets (they are fierce)
- Capsules are weapons
- Triangles are types of health
- Obake is a 3 wheeled car
- Learn how to do tricks! (Triangle or Shift)
- Gap points are transparent blue
- Speedtrap is transparent red

- Circle + left or R is the Teleport function
- Discover more functions using Circle"
